# Accepted vulnerabilities for Trivy
# These are issues present in the base OS image (Debian Bookworm) that are either
# false positives in our context or awaiting upstream patches.

# zlib1g: integer overflow in MiniZip (MiniZip is not used by our app)
CVE-2023-45853

# libzvbi0: various integer overflows and uninitialized pointers in VBI decoding
# (Our app only uses ffmpeg which might dynamically link it, but we don't process VBI captions)
CVE-2025-2173
CVE-2025-2174
CVE-2025-2176
CVE-2025-2175
CVE-2025-2177
